Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:58:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: accept an explicit VPC ID

VPC metadata discovery is unavailable in some restricted worker
environments. Accept a configured VPC ID and use metadata discovery only
when that value is absent. Leave the other cloud providers unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Generated-by: OpenAI Codex
